# Lecture 05C

## Pedigrees

## Chapter 5

## Dr. Neil Voss

## Sept 29, 2026

=== layout: one-panel

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Read pedigree symbols and relationships
- Compare dominant and recessive inheritance
- Distinguish autosomal, X-linked, and Y-linked patterns
- Use family evidence to infer genotypes

@notes

Students should explain which family relationships support or exclude a model, rather than classify by appearance alone.

